"device theming" is a notebook page
	<header level="1">
		Device
		<header>A device draws a phone, tablet or desktop round what it holds, at that device's screen size, with buttons in its thick bottom edge.</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Set a public `--ui-*` token on the element, any ancestor or `:root`; it inherits into the shadow
			root. Edit a value below to try it.
		</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-device" playground>
				<ui-device device="phone">
					<ui-segment appearance="basic">
						<ui-header size="large">Hello</>
						<ui-text paragraph>An app on a phone's screen, 390 by 844.</>
						<ui-button color="primary">Start</>
					</>
					<ui-button slot="buttons" size="small" color="primary">Done</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot.
			A device is hardware:  its frame stays dark in every theme;  what it holds wears the theme.
		</>
	</>
